{"ocrText": "V.  I.  LENIN\n42\npressed peoples, in the war against the German and British\nimperialists, who cannot join forces against you because\nthey are locked in a life-and-death struggle against each\nother, and because they are in a hopeless position, in which\nthe Russian revolution\u2019s foreign policy, a sincere and real\nalliance with the oppressed classes, the oppressed peoples,\ncan be successful\u2014it has 99 chances in 100 of being suc-\ncessful!\nRecently we read in our Moscow Party newspaper a letter\nfrom a peasant commenting on our programme. I should like\nto bring my speech to a close with a brief quotation from\nthat letter, showing what a peasant makes of our programme.\nThe letter was printed in No. 59 of Sotsial-Demokrat,22\nour Moscow Party newspaper, and was reprinted in Pravda\nNo.  68.23\n\u201cWe must,\u201d says the letter, \u201cpress the bourgeoisie harder\nto make them burst at the seams. Then the war will be over.\nBut things will turn out badly if we don\u2019t press the bour-\ngeoisie  hard  enough.\u201d  (Applause.)\nPravda  Nos.  95, 96  and  97,\nPublished according to\nJuly  13,  14  and  15  (June  30,\nthe  Pravda  text  checked\nJuly  1   and  2),  1917\nwith  the  verbatim  report\nedited  by  Lenin", "textLayer": [{"text": "V.  I.  LENIN", "x": 44.62, "y": 6.11, "w": 13.0, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "42", "x": 11.11, "y": 6.06, "w": 2.39, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "pressed peoples, in the war against the German and British", "x": 11.11, "y": 9.53, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "imperialists, who cannot join forces against you because", "x": 11.11, "y": 11.47, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "they are locked in a life-and-death struggle against each", "x": 11.11, "y": 13.39, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "other, and because they are in a hopeless position, in which", "x": 11.11, "y": 15.33, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "the Russian revolution\u2019s foreign policy, a sincere and real", "x": 11.11, "y": 17.27, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "alliance with the oppressed classes, the oppressed peoples,", "x": 11.11, "y": 19.2, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "can be successful\u2014it has 99 chances in 100 of being suc-", "x": 11.11, "y": 21.14, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "cessful!", "x": 11.11, "y": 23.08, "w": 9.77, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Recently we read in our Moscow Party newspaper a letter", "x": 13.9, "y": 25.0, "w": 77.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "from a peasant commenting on our programme. I should like", "x": 11.11, "y": 26.94, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "to bring my speech to a close with a brief quotation from", "x": 11.11, "y": 28.88, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "that letter, showing what a peasant makes of our programme.", "x": 11.11, "y": 30.82, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "The letter was printed in No. 59 of", "x": 11.11, "y": 32.76, "w": 52.63, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "S", "x": 64.68, "y": 32.85, "w": 1.62, "h": 1.76, "fontSize": 10.4}, {"text": "otsial-Demokrat", "x": 66.46, "y": 32.78, "w": 21.69, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ",", "x": 88.3, "y": 32.76, "w": 0.73, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "22", "x": 89.19, "y": 32.66, "w": 1.91, "h": 1.16, "fontSize": 6.9}, {"text": "our Moscow Party newspaper, and was reprinted in", "x": 11.11, "y": 34.7, "w": 70.08, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Pravda", "x": 81.66, "y": 34.72, "w": 9.46, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "No.  68.", "x": 11.11, "y": 36.62, "w": 9.16, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "23", "x": 20.3, "y": 36.52, "w": 1.81, "h": 1.16, "fontSize": 6.9}, {"text": "\u201cWe must,\u201d says the letter, \u201cpress the bourgeoisie harder", "x": 13.9, "y": 38.56, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "to make them burst at the seams. Then the war will be over.", "x": 11.11, "y": 40.5, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "But things will turn out badly if we don\u2019t press the bour-", "x": 11.11, "y": 42.44, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "geoisie  hard  enough.\u201d  (", "x": 11.11, "y": 44.38, "w": 30.37, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Applause", "x": 41.54, "y": 44.39, "w": 11.55, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ".)", "x": 53.13, "y": 44.38, "w": 1.7, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Pravda", "x": 11.44, "y": 48.26, "w": 7.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Nos.", "x": 19.5, "y": 48.25, "w": 4.22, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "95", "x": 24.62, "y": 48.3, "w": 2.13, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": ",", "x": 26.99, "y": 48.25, "w": 1.14, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "96", "x": 28.27, "y": 48.3, "w": 2.14, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "and", "x": 31.41, "y": 48.25, "w": 3.45, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "97", "x": 35.79, "y": 48.3, "w": 2.03, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": ",", "x": 38.04, "y": 48.25, "w": 0.53, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Published according to", "x": 67.85, "y": 48.25, "w": 22.07, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "July", "x": 11.11, "y": 49.6, "w": 3.99, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "13", "x": 16.03, "y": 49.66, "w": 1.9, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": ",", "x": 18.16, "y": 49.6, "w": 0.53, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "14", "x": 19.61, "y": 49.66, "w": 1.9, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "and", "x": 22.52, "y": 49.6, "w": 3.45, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "15", "x": 26.9, "y": 49.66, "w": 1.9, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "(June", "x": 29.81, "y": 49.6, "w": 5.33, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "30", "x": 36.06, "y": 49.66, "w": 2.12, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": ",", "x": 38.4, "y": 49.6, "w": 0.53, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}